## SQ-HH-321 | `raw_rock_salt_block: [1-9]\d{2,}` (at least 100 blocks over 144 deser
# setup/shell: qrun.py toml
> locate biome minecraft:desert
waitlog nearest minecraft:desert is at 300
capture D is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {D1-96} {D3-96} {D1+95} {D3+95}
sleep 120
> zhh2 countset {D1-96} -60 {D3-96} {D1+95} 60 {D3+95} salt:raw_rock_salt_block,salt:salt_cluster,minecraft:calcite
look UNPARSED CMD: saltCaveRarity 1 ;; saltCaveMinY -40 ;; saltCaveMaxY 30 ;; cp ;; OUT/srv/config/
look `raw_rock_salt_block: [1-9]\d{2,}` (at least 100 blocks over 144 desert chunks with rarity 1, J33 placed feature plus biome modifier; `canPlace` rejects some sites over water or lava, not most)

